# Agentic systems (scoped)

When building AI/agent features:

1. Load skill `agentic-system-design`
2. Hard cap on agent loop steps
3. Strict tool schemas; idempotent where retried
4. Human checkpoint before irreversible actions
5. Eval dataset before shipping user-facing agent behavior
6. Log model, tokens, latency, tool calls

Skills in repo for cloud: commit `.cursor/skills/` — global `~/.cursor/` does not sync.
